                  "blocks": {
                    "text_DQPAxx": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Free ground shipping on all national orders.</p><p>Every Pocket Square™ is handcrafted and finished in our New Orleans studio. Please allow approximately 2–3 weeks for your piece to be made before shipping.</p><p>Each piece arrives in a Jose Balli box and pouch, ready to gift.</p>",
